Filey changes to FigCraft's web app (Office work > Fig): the control bridge
(apps/figcraft-web: figcraftControl/figcraftOpen) that lets the Filey agent drive it with
FigCraft's control channel, File > Save as a .figcraft download in the web build (it had no file
system, so Save did nothing), and the app named "Fig" where users see it.
Upstream: https://github.com/storytold/figcraft commit 3f5f673ebc72228550448f6f3a008c98a61feac2 (main). MIT OR Apache-2.0.

Build: git apply filey-control.patch; cd apps/figcraft-web; trunk build --release (CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 on 8 GB machines)
Install: node scripts/fetch-office-apps.mjs --app figcraft --from <figcraft>/dist/web (copy LICENSE-MIT/APACHE in first)

